        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction",
        "PMC12654518::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12565319::web::020::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A stable, dense, and refined microstructure reduces defect formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A stable, dense, and refined microstructure increases passive-film stability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed microstructure improves wear resistance.",
